            "textSha256": "960d0d04f0acafa62611e4f974d730298a7e601bdd5ba799021efcba064c6b19"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "Enjoy a full-day excursion to Caracol, the largest Maya site in Belize. Walk through ancient courtyards, plazas, ball courts and climb Caana, the tallest Maya structure in the country. On your return, stop at Rio Frio Cave and Rio On Pools in the Mountain Pine Ridge for a refreshing swim and relaxation before heading back to your lodge."
